# Potential QBot Activity | T1059.005 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules-emerging-threats/2019/Malware/QBot/proc_creation_win_malware_qbot.yml
source="WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=1 ((ParentImage="*\\WinRAR.exe" Image="*\\wscript.exe") OR CommandLine="* /c ping.exe -n 6 127.0.0.1 & type *" OR (CommandLine="*regsvr32.exe*" CommandLine="*C:\\ProgramData*" CommandLine="*.tmp*"))
